2026-05-03T18:49:26+00:00\",\"slug\":\"perche-potresti-aspettare-prima-di-comprare-un-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Perché potresti aspettare prima di comprare un MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha aggiornato il MacBook Pro 14” e 16” con M5 Pro e M5 Max, ma i rumor indicano un salto di generazione con display OLED touch, nuovo design e chip a processo 2nm nel 2026-2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14443,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-ultra-fino-a-sei-nuove-funzioni\",\"title\":\"Apple “MacBook Ultra”: fino a sei nuove funzioni in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple starebbe preparando un grande redesign per i MacBook Pro di fascia alta, con possibile branding “MacBook Ultra” e fino a sei nuove funzioni: OLED, touch, Dynamic Island, chip M6 Pro/M6 Max, design più sottile e connettività cellulare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14324,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-oled-arrivo-ipad-mini-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Apple: OLED in arrivo per iPad mini e MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo ETNews, Apple introdurrà display OLED su iPad mini e MacBook Pro nel corso di quest’anno. Samsung fornirebbe i pannelli.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13972,\"date\":\"2026-03-21T18:19:42+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-21T17:20:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"migliori-offerte-apple-settimana-airpods-pro-3\",\"title\":\"Le Migliori Offerte Apple della Settimana: AirPods Pro 3 a 208,00 €, Prezzo Più Basso su Amazon\",\"excerpt\":\"Questa settimana, le offerte Apple includono il ritorno del prezzo più basso di sempre per gli AirPods Pro 3, Apple Watch Series 11 e sconti sui nuovi prodotti Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Best-Apple-Deals-Feature-Shelf-0004-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Best Apple Deals Feature Shelf\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13637,\"date\":\"2026-03-04T19:02:16+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-04T20:39:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-sette-nuovi-prodotti\",\"title\":\"Apple ha presentato sette nuovi prodotti questa settimana\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha svelato sette nuovi prodotti, tra cui un iPhone 17e, un iPad Air con chip M4, e nuovi modelli di MacBook Air e MacBook Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Announces-Special-Event-in-New-York-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Announces Special Event in New York Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":26,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13555,\"date\":\"2026-03-02T17:31:03+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-02T20:29:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-presenta-nuovo-ipad-air-chip-m4\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta il nuovo iPad Air con chip M4, RAM aumentata, Wi-Fi 7 e altro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha introdotto un nuovo iPad Air, dotato del chip M4 per prestazioni più veloci, 12GB di RAM, chip N1 con supporto Wi-Fi 7 e modem C1X per modelli cellulari.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iPad-Air-M4-Chip-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPad Air M Chip\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":26,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13438,\"date\":\"2026-02-28T13:08:13+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:46:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macbook-pro-oled-touchscreen-2026\",\"title\":\"MacBook Pro OLED con Touchscreen in Arrivo nel 2026 con Dynamic Island e Controlli macOS Ridisegnati\",\"excerpt\":\"Il nuovo MacBook Pro OLED con touchscreen in sviluppo da Apple adotterà il Dynamic Island dell'iPhone e un design macOS ottimizzato per il touch.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple MacBook Pro M hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":27,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13422,\"date\":\"2026-02-28T13:07:46+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:39:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-record-vendite-iphone-europa-2025\",\"title\":\"Apple Stabilisce un Record di Vendite di iPhone in Europa nel 2025\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha spedito 36,9 milioni di iPhone in Europa nel 2025, registrando una crescita del 6% rispetto all'anno precedente e conquistando una quota record del 27% del mercato degli smartphone nella regione.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-iPhone-16-family-lineup-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple iPhone family lineup\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":26,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13506,\"date\":\"2026-02-28T03:30:32+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:37:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cosa-aspettarsi-dalla-grande-settimana-di-apple\",\"title\":\"Cosa Aspettarsi dalla Grande Settimana di Apple: iPhone 17e, MacBook Economico, Nuovi iPad e Altro\",\"excerpt\":\"A partire da lunedì, Apple annuncerà i suoi primi importanti prodotti del 2026, tra cui l'iPhone 17e e un nuovo MacBook economico.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-Announces-Special-Event-in-New-York-Feature-1-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Announces Special Event in New York Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvata